OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with frequent showers,
OL,6,Fheavy at times with a risk of thunder.
OL,7,FSome drier and possibly bright spells
OL,8,Flater. Feeling chilliest in the north
OL,9,Fand windy along coasts, milder
OL,10,Felsewhere.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few showers persisting this
OL,13,Fevening before a band of more
OL,14,Forganised rain arrives later and into
OL,15,Fthe night. Heavy in places with gusty
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
