OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA generally cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and showers
OL,7,Fthroughout. A risk of thunder at times
OL,8,Fassociated with heavier showers and
OL,9,Fgusty winds. Temperatures closer to
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fon Friday, clearing into the afternoon
OL,14,Fand becoming colder with widespread
OL,15,Ffrost overnight. A fine start to the
OL,16,Fweekend but turning much windier with
OL,17,Frain likely on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
